<title>USA: Totalbank to buy Universal National.</title>
<headline>Totalbank to buy Universal National.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Totalbank said Wednesday it had agreed to acquire Universal National Bancorp Inc, a southern Florida bank with $80 million in assets.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Totalbank has assets of $225 million and 10 locations in southern Florida.</p>
</text>
